abstract: "Fault-injection benchmark on official NYC TLC data (32 primary scenarios, 3 exploratory held-out scenarios, 120 generations, 46,080 + 4,320 episodes) with prompts, deterministic validators, archived programs, episode-level results and reproduction scripts. The NYC TLC data are not redistributed."
